; Accepted deviation: a pad is sized from the balance with every padding before it.
; Beancount sizes the pad of the parent account without the padding of its
; sub-account, so it pads 60 where 40 are missing, and the parent's assertion fails.
; Zhang pads the sub-account by 60 and the parent by 40, and both assertions hold.
option "operating_currency" "CNY"

